{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>開發者David Oberhollenzer製作了一個特殊的ZIP文件，既能像普通壓縮包一樣解壓，還能作為啓動鏡像，讓支持傳統BIOS的電腦直接運行其中的程序。</strong>這個名為boot.zip的文件並不是簡單把啓動文件塞進壓縮包，而是同時滿足ZIP格式、Multiboot啓動規範和傳統BIOS啓動要求，使用常規解壓工具檢查時，文件內容可以正常讀取。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586728.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:29:31.940064+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":177,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T06:13:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T06:22:50.383377+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T06:22:50.383377+00:00","content_hash":"3b43a6a608f0ea13647bc13caa209a3998488063c78ac50f2fb716ce1267dc49","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}